resolution: "Pinned jscpd 5.1.1 with its resolved lock graph and release-age policy exception; retained the evidence-backed incompatible npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 deferrals; recorded passing zero-duplication, exact coverage, and full static-quality executions."
